### Click "Send Request" above each block (VS Code "REST Client" extension),
### or copy the curl equivalents from docs/02-USER-GUIDE.md.
@base = http://127.0.0.1:8001

### Health check
GET {{base}}/

### Readiness (checks the database)
GET {{base}}/health/ready

### Send a webhook (change the id to get a new transaction)
POST {{base}}/v1/webhooks/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "transaction_id": "txn_debug_001",
  "source_account": "acc_user_789",
  "destination_account": "acc_merchant_456",
  "amount": 1500,
  "currency": "INR"
}

### Query its status (PROCESSING, then PROCESSED after the delay)
GET {{base}}/v1/transactions/txn_debug_001

### Duplicate with a different amount: 202, original kept, flagged
POST {{base}}/v1/webhooks/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "transaction_id": "txn_debug_001",
  "source_account": "acc_user_789",
  "destination_account": "acc_merchant_456",
  "amount": 9999,
  "currency": "INR"
}

### Invalid payload: 422
POST {{base}}/v1/webhooks/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{ "transaction_id": "txn_bad", "amount": -1 }

### Unknown transaction: 404
GET {{base}}/v1/transactions/txn_does_not_exist
